hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18497","Yahya narrated to us, from Sufyan who said: Abu Ishaq narrated to me, he said: I heard Sulayman ibn Surad say: He said."
"18498","And Abd al-Rahman narrated to us, from Sufyan, from Abi Ishaq, from Sulayman ibn Surad who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said on the Day of the Confederates, Yahya means on the Day of the Trench: Now we will raid them and they will not raid us."
"18499","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, he said: I heard Aba Ishaq, from Sulayman ibn Surad who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) turned back on the Day of the Confederates and said: Now we will raid them and they will not raid us."
